  "title": "Fast Salmon with a Ginger Glaze",
  "description": "Chef John&#39;s fast, delicious ginger, garlic, seasoned rice wine vinegar, brown sugar, chili sauce, and soy sauce glaze recipe is perfect on grilled salmon.",
